        "639": { n: "Substrate surface readiness before application", t: "Surface quality (sags, protrusions) not more than 2 mm. Pit or cavity depth is permitted not more than 5 mm; cement laitance, dirt, grease, bitumen and oil stains and other contaminants must be removed from the concrete surface" },
        "640": { n: "Joint raking and chase filling", t: "In the form of a 30x30 mm groove and filling it with a special non-shrink repair compound. Pointing of joints and filling the groove with repair compound" },
        "641": { n: "Layer thickness", t: "Not less than 2 layers. The second layer is applied perpendicular to the first, thickness of one layer not less than 1 mm" },
        "642": { n: "Compliance with curing regime after application", t: "For the next two days, air and substrate surface temperature must be not lower than +5°C and not higher than +30°C. During hardening (at least 24 hours) the surface must be protected by covering from rain, prolonged direct sunlight and freezing." },

