        "921": { n: "Concrete curing (temperature-humidity regime)", t: "Screeds and monolithic toppings on a cement binder should be kept moist for not less than 7 days after laying, under a moisture-retaining material layer, unless otherwise specified by the material manufacturer. SP 71.13330.2017 8.1.12" },
