        "923": { n: "Cutting into panels/sections", t: "WEP. SP 71.13330.2017 cl.5.1.9: shrinkage joints up to 10 mm wide divide a cement-sand screed into panels not exceeding 6×6 m, and a sand-asphalt-concrete screed into panels not exceeding 4×4 m" },
