        "1408": { n: "Setting/bearing blocks", t: "GOST 30971-2020 G.1.4. TS. WEP. Material - rigid plastic (PVC, polypropylene), caprolon, aluminum with rubber gaskets. Prohibited: wood, polystyrene foam (unstable under load).Width: ≥40 mm (must exceed profile width by 5–10 mm).\n- Height: 15–30 mm (selected to suit the gap).\n- Length: ≥60 mm (for even load distribution).\n- Spacing: ≤600 mm for aluminum profiles, ≤400 mm for heavy glazing units.\n- Offset from corner: ≤150 mm.\n- Mandatory: under all vertical posts and mullions." },
