        "4406": { n: "Absence of defects", t: "Internal company standard (Table 7.7 of SP 71.13330.2017 was deleted by Amendment No.3, effective 01.02.2026). Bubbles, cracks, peeling are not permitted. Roller lint — ≤3 pcs/m² (class K2). Coat overlap not less than 50% of the roller width." },
