        "4411": { n: "Smoothness of sash operation", t: "No sticking" },
        "4412": { n: "Control of pattern, texture, and dimensions", t: "\"SP 71.13330.2017\" cl. 7.4.9\nFinishing of a section and of the whole interior surface with facing products of different colors, finishes, textures and sizes shall be carried out with selection of the entire facing pattern in accordance with the requirements of the project and working documentation" },
        "4413": { n: "Void-free space under the tile", t: "\"SP 71.13330.2017\" cl. 7.4.6\nA void-free space must be ensured" },
        "4414": { n: "Cladding cleaning", t: "\"SP 71.13330.2017\" cl. 7.4.12\nAfter facing, surfaces of slabs and products must be cleaned of mortar and mastic runs immediately; surfaces of non-absorbent materials are washed with hot water, surfaces of absorbent materials are treated with special compounds and steam" },
        "4415": { n: "Joint execution", t: "\"SP 71.13330.2017\" cl. 7.4.13\nFacing joints must be even and of equal width (see facing type). One day after the hardening or polymerization of the materials (the technological pause may be shortened if provided for by the WEP or by the requirement of the adhesive layer material manufacturer) used for the facing, joints must be filled with special jointing materials (grouts) per GOST R 58271" },
        "4416": { n: "Mirror-polished, polished", t: "\"SP 71.13330.2017\" Table 7.6\nDeviation from vertical not more than 2 mm per 1 m of length. (4 mm per floor)\nDeviations of joint positions from vertical and horizontal not more than 1,5 mm per 1 m of length.\nDeviations of joint width not more than +/- 0,5mm.\nProfile mismatches at junctions of architectural and construction elements and joints not more than 0,5mm.\nCladding surface unevenness (checked with a two-meter straightedge) not more than 2 mm." },
        "4417": { n: "Sanded, spotted, rough, grooved", t: "Internal company standard (SP 71.13330.2017, table 7.6 does not regulate the joint-width deviation for this texture — a dash in the table): Deviation from vertical not more than 3 mm per 1 m (8 mm per storey). Joint deviations not more than 3 mm per 1 m. Joint-width deviations not more than +/- 1 mm. Plane irregularities (2 m straightedge) not more than 4 mm." },
        "4418": { n: "\"Rock\" type texture", t: "\"SP 71.13330.2017\" Table 7.6\nDeviations of joint positions from vertical and horizontal not more than 3 mm per 1 m of length.\nProfile mismatches at junctions of architectural and construction elements and joints not more than 2 mm. Deviations of joint width not more than +/- 2mm" },
        "4419": { n: "Of granite and artificial stone", t: "\"SP 71.13330.2017\" Table 7.6\nDeviations in joint width position not more than +/- 0,5 mm" },
        "4420": { n: "Of marble", t: "\"SP 71.13330.2017\" Table 7.6\nDeviations in joint width position not more than +/- 0,5 mm" },
        "4421": { n: "Of ceramic, glass-ceramic and other products.", t: "\"SP 71.13330.2017\" Table 7.6\nDeviation from vertical not more than 1,5 mm per 1 m of length. (4 mm per floor)\nDeviations of joint positions from vertical and horizontal not more than 1,5 mm per 1 m of length.\nDeviations of joint width not more than +/- 0,5mm.\nProfile mismatches at junctions of architectural and construction elements and joints not more than 3 mm per 1 m.\nCladding surface unevenness (checked with a two-meter straightedge) not more than 2 mm" },
        "4422": { n: "Rail/grid spacing", t: "Internal company standard (Armstrong and Albes installation guides (600/1200 mm spacing)). 1200 mm (standard), 600 mm (reinforced)" },
